				691,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement extension host message forwarding to Cocoon\n\nReplace the TODO placeholder in the cocoon:extensionHostMessage handler with actual gRPC forwarding logic. The handler now extracts the payload from the Wind IPC args and forwards it to Cocoon's gRPC server using the Vine::Client::SendNotification RPC as a generic notification.\n\nThis completes the Wind → Mountain → Cocoon message relay path, enabling the extension host protocol to flow between the editor frontend (Wind) and the extension host sidecar (Cocoon). The forward is fire-and-forget to maintain async protocol behavior.\n\nAlso applies minor formatting cleanup to the extensions:getAll handler's debug logging.",
